<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Bill of Materials & Recipe Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            The architectural blueprint of your product line—managing complex material 
            hierarchies and formulation recipes with absolute structural integrity.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Level Hierarchy & Complexity</h2>
        <p>
            Standardize your product architecture with support for complex, multi-level 
            hierarchies. Define exactly how raw materials are converted into 
            sub-assemblies or intermediate granules, and ultimately into finished 
            goods ready for packaging. Pindah BOM management allows for the precise 
            configuration of component quantities, units of measure, and associated 
            scrap/yield factors, ensuring that material requirements are always 
            computed accurately during production planning.
        </p>
        <p>
            Substitution rules allow for the configuration of alternative components—essential 
            for maintaining production continuity during raw material supply 
            disruptions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Governance & Version Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Secure your formulation secrets and production standards with comprehensive version 
            control. The system tracks the complete evolution of every BOM, managing 
            approvals and effective-date boundaries for new revisions. This rigor 
            prevents the use of obsolete recipes on the shop floor and ensures that 
            your facility is always compliant with its internal quality standards 
             and external regulatory certifications (e.g., WHO GMP).
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Cost Rollup & Impact</h2>
        <p>
            Empower your financial team with instantaneous margin visibility. The automated cost 
            rollup engine aggregates raw material standard costs throughout the BOM 
            hierarchy to compute the total material cost of a finished product. Correlating 
            BOM data with real-time procurement price shifts identifies margin 
            erosion early, facilitating data-driven decisions on product pricing 
            and sourcing strategies.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

